  "title": "Global Credit Union selects NCR Atleos ATMs to support new Utqiaġvik branch in Alaska’s northernmost city",
  "summary": "NCR Atleos Corporation (NYSE: NATL) (“Atleos”), a leader in expanding self-service financial access for financial institutions, retailers and consumers, today announced that Global Credit Union (“Global”) is deploying Atleos ATMs at its newly established branch in Utqiaġvik, Alaska, the northernmost city in the United States. The deployment supports Global’s presence in the North Slope region of the state and reflects the use of Atleos self‑service banking technology in some of the world’s most remote environments.",
